# Chthonia's menu: a beginner's subset of the one command vocabulary, in the
# format of profiles/default.menu. File carries the project rows (a second
# file added to the program makes it a project) and Build the native build:
# the Build… item's menu lists the build rows themselves (Check, Build, Run,
# Stop, and a project's own). View ▸ Outline shows the outline in the
# sidebar beside Symbols (chthonia.layout), View ▸ Markdown preview a .md
# buffer rendered there; Output and Terminal are the
# bottom panel's tabs for a build and the program it runs. View ▸ Changes,
# History and Blame line are git's (madcide_git.inc): the file against its
# last commit, its commits, who last changed the caret's line. View ▸
# Increase / Decrease font size and Full screen: the window's.

File new New
File editfile Open…
File recent Recent files…
File close Close
File closeall Close all
File save Save [editable]
File saveall Save All
File saveas Save As… [editable]
File -
File project Project…
File openproject Open Project…
File projaddcur Add Current File to Project
File -
File quit Quit

Edit undo Undo [editable && !viewing]
Edit redo Redo [editable && !viewing]
Edit -
Edit cut Cut [selection && editable]
Edit copy Copy [selection]
Edit paste Paste [editable]
Edit -
Edit selectall Select all
Edit -
Edit indent Indent selected lines [editable]
Edit dedent Dedent selected lines [editable]
Edit togglecomment Toggle comment [editable]
Edit -
Edit find Find…
Edit replace Replace… [editable]
Edit gotoline Go to line…
Edit -
Edit replclear Clear shell

Run replrun Run
Run replstop Stop
Run replinterrupt Interrupt
Run repleof Send EOF
Run language Language…

Build build Build…

View repl Shell
View symbols Symbols
View problems Problems
View output Output
View terminal Terminal
View outline Outline
View mdpreview Markdown preview
View gitchanges Changes
View githistory History…
View gitblame Blame line
View progargs Program arguments…
View -
View fontlarger Increase font size [window]
View fontsmaller Decrease font size [window]
View fullscreen Full screen [window]

Tools keystyle Key bindings…
Tools options Options…

Help helpcontents Help Contents
Help help Keyboard Help
Help about About Chthonia

# The toolbar (the placement word `toolbar`, plan §41.11a): its buttons, each
# with its picture — {ICON [MENU]}, ui::icon's vocabulary and the menu its
# arrow drops down (the mockup's Run ▾). Debug, the steps and the
# breakpoints join with the debugger.
toolbar new {new} New
toolbar editfile {open} Open
toolbar save {save} Save [editable]
toolbar -
toolbar replrun {run Run} Run
toolbar replstop {stop} Stop
